WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:03.830
<b>This is the work of a curse.</b>

00:03.830 --> 00:05.250
<b>A curse?</b>

00:05.460 --> 00:07.170
<b>Like an evil magic spell.</b>

00:07.380 --> 00:11.540
<b>It's filled your head with a bunch of false memories
and that's what making you so confused.</b>

00:11.790 --> 00:14.130
<b>Hold on a minute. That can happen?</b>

00:14.290 --> 00:16.750
<b>Well, it's a very specialized type of curse.</b>

00:17.080 --> 00:19.380
<b>Where did you even go to get struck by one like this?</b>

00:19.830 --> 00:22.420
<b>So, then... my time with Goddess Hestia...</b>

00:22.960 --> 00:26.040
<b>Even the memories I have of meeting
Welf, Lili, and the others...</b>

00:26.420 --> 00:27.580
<b>They're all fake?</b>

00:28.170 --> 00:29.330
<b>No way!</b>

00:30.290 --> 00:32.750
<b>Heith. Hurry and break the curse.</b>

00:32.880 --> 00:35.500
<b>My expertise is limited to healing wounds.</b>

00:35.500 --> 00:40.500
<b>And besides, this curse is too powerful. The only person
who can get rid of something this bad is Dea Saint.</b>

00:40.630 --> 00:42.670
<b>The best healer in all of Orario, eh?</b>

00:42.830 --> 00:45.460
<b>But asking for her help would put us
in debt to the Dian Cecht Familia...</b>

00:45.460 --> 00:46.170
<b>Bad idea.</b>

00:46.170 --> 00:46.710
<b>Awful.</b>

00:46.710 --> 00:47.500
<b>The worst.</b>

00:47.500 --> 00:50.040
<b>There's not much else we can do at this point, right?</b>

00:50.250 --> 00:53.210
<b>The best way to handle this is for you to forget all
those weird memories.</b>

00:53.630 --> 00:57.630
<b>Forget them? Everything about
Goddess Hestia and my friends?</b>

00:57.920 --> 00:58.960
<b>I could never...</b>

00:59.540 --> 01:01.250
<b>I'll make all the arrangements.</b>

01:01.540 --> 01:02.630
<b>Come along, Bell.</b>

01:04.790 --> 01:05.580
<b>No!</b>

01:07.250 --> 01:09.580
<b>Oh, I'm s-sorry!</b>

01:10.000 --> 01:12.170
<b>It's affecting him worse than I thought.</b>

01:17.460 --> 01:19.250
<b>Master, I...</b>

01:19.630 --> 01:22.790
<b>Just behave yourself until Lady Freya returns.</b>

01:26.210 --> 01:31.250
<b>Kyou no story toki ni yo wa irony</b>

01:31.500 --> 01:35.380
<b>"Soredemo..." tte kokoro ni</b>

01:35.380 --> 01:40.960
<b>Mitsuke dashita bokura no sekai</b>

01:50.420 --> 01:55.880
<b>Ano hi kara koko ni iru motome tsuzuke sagashiteru</b>

01:56.130 --> 02:02.670
<b>Yowasa ni deau tabi ikutsumo ikutsumo koenakucha</b>

02:02.670 --> 02:06.670
<b>Sono tabi ni namida o koraete wa</b>

02:06.920 --> 02:11.710
<b>Tachiagatte asu asatte sou yattekita no sa</b>

02:11.880 --> 02:17.000
<b>Kore made o shinjite susunda sono saki de</b>

02:17.170 --> 02:21.960
<b>Kakegaenonai mono bokura o matsu</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:26.670
<b>Bouken no story hajimari wa kyou de ii</b>

02:26.960 --> 02:32.750
<b>Itamashii elegy dare mo utawanuyou ni</b>

02:33.130 --> 02:37.630
<b>Aa tsuyoku naritai hangeki no hajimari</b>

02:37.750 --> 02:41.170
<b>Kakkowarukute ii</b>

02:41.540 --> 02:47.250
<b>Aa deai ga ai soko ni itanda ne</b>

02:56.080 --> 02:59.830
<b>Orario</b>

02:56.080 --> 02:59.830
<b>Distorted City</b>

02:57.630 --> 03:01.420
<b>You remember the terms of
the deal that we made, right, Horn?</b>

03:02.130 --> 03:04.710
<b>You're no longer allowed to come in contact with Bell.</b>

03:04.920 --> 03:07.460
<b>I won't even stand for you entering his line of sight.</b>

03:08.420 --> 03:10.000
<b>Yes, Lady Freya.</b>

03:10.580 --> 03:14.080
<b>So I'm going to have you do
some work by becoming me instead.</b>

03:14.790 --> 03:18.080
<b>Whenever I cast my charm over a wide area,
there are always places that slip through the cracks.</b>

03:18.380 --> 03:21.210
<b>For starters, it didn't reach the inside of the dungeon.</b>

03:21.960 --> 03:26.170
<b>You want me to determine who was in the dungeon
at the time and make sure they get charmed, yes?</b>

03:26.380 --> 03:30.170
<b>Yes. Same for any children
who come from outside the city.</b>

03:30.670 --> 03:31.540
<b>Understood.</b>

03:32.250 --> 03:35.210
<b>What about the people living
in Rivira down on the 18th floor?</b>

03:35.420 --> 03:37.460
<b>I've already taken measures to deal with them.</b>

03:38.420 --> 03:40.630
<b>There's something I needed from down there, anyways.</b>

03:41.830 --> 03:46.380
<b>Once you're finished, I want you to make
doubly sure the Hestia Familia are staying in line.</b>

03:46.710 --> 03:49.830
<b>Those children are too deeply connected with Bell.</b>

03:50.170 --> 03:50.880
<b>Okay.</b>

03:52.750 --> 03:56.830
<b>Lady Freya. Are you certain that I won't be facing any
sort of punishment?</b>

03:57.670 --> 04:00.580
<b>Not only did I lie to you,
but I attempted to kill Bell Cranel...</b>

04:00.580 --> 04:02.420
<b>I'm letting you go unpunished.</b>

04:03.790 --> 04:06.630
<b>Because as far as you're concerned,
that's the worst punishment imaginable, right?</b>

04:08.540 --> 04:10.830
<b>Continue to devote yourself in service to me.</b>

04:12.130 --> 04:13.460
<b>As you wish.</b>

04:19.540 --> 04:22.210
<b>I never imagined Freya's ability was so powerful.</b>

04:24.080 --> 04:26.420
<b>Bell... Forgive me...</b>

04:27.670 --> 04:29.500
<b>I'm sorry that I have to leave you all alone...</b>

04:30.130 --> 04:32.380
<b>Well, if it isn't Hestia!</b>

04:33.540 --> 04:34.710
<b>Hermes!</b>

04:35.750 --> 04:37.830
<b>Hey, about what happened yesterday...</b>

04:37.830 --> 04:40.380
<b>Yesterday? What are you talking about?</b>

04:41.830 --> 04:44.710
<b>When the time is right, you need to give this to me.</b>

04:44.960 --> 04:46.500
<b>Don't try and do it immediately!</b>

04:46.790 --> 04:50.170
<b>If you screw up the timing,
then I'll just end up being your enemy instead!</b>

04:50.750 --> 04:53.830
<b>Hey, what's the matter? You're acting weird.</b>

04:54.040 --> 04:56.210
<b>It's nothing. Sorry.</b>

05:10.080 --> 05:11.380
<b>Wallen-whatsit.</b>

05:11.790 --> 05:13.080
<b>Lady Hestia?</b>

05:13.500 --> 05:15.130
<b>What are you doing out here?</b>

05:15.830 --> 05:16.630
<b>I don't know...</b>

05:16.960 --> 05:18.080
<b>What do you mean?</b>

05:18.330 --> 05:20.210
<b>I'm not sure why I came here.</b>

05:20.830 --> 05:22.880
<b>It feels like I was looking for something.</b>

05:23.670 --> 05:25.290
<b>Or maybe I wanted to meet someone...</b>

05:27.080 --> 05:28.710
<b>Do you know who Bell is?</b>

05:30.130 --> 05:32.420
<b>You mean Bell Cranel from the Freya Familia?</b>

05:33.790 --> 05:37.960
<b>Exactly. I need you to do me a favor
and stay away from him.</b>

05:38.210 --> 05:40.630
<b>Stay away? But why?</b>

05:41.040 --> 05:44.580
<b>Bell's infatuation with this girl
is the source of all his strength.</b>

05:44.830 --> 05:49.290
<b>So it's possible that getting rejected by her would
make him unable to resist Freya's influence.</b>

05:50.210 --> 05:51.250
<b>I can't tell you that.</b>

05:53.080 --> 05:54.170
<b>All right.</b>

05:55.210 --> 05:57.630
<b>Sorry. And thank you.</b>

06:04.960 --> 06:10.420
<b>Seems I was right to assume my power wouldn't work on
you, since you're protected by the altar down here.</b>

06:10.420 --> 06:11.420
<b>Right, Ouranos?</b>

06:11.670 --> 06:14.920
<b>Freya. Are you here to try and mesmerize me?</b>

06:15.330 --> 06:20.960
<b>Don't be silly. Your existence here is fundamental to
maintaining the stability of Orario.</b>

06:21.130 --> 06:22.920
<b>Then why are you here?</b>

06:23.290 --> 06:24.330
<b>To strike a deal.</b>

06:24.330 --> 06:31.040
<b>I want to make Bell mine. I want to own all of him,
from his body to his heart and mind.</b>

06:31.790 --> 06:34.040
<b>Please just stay out of this.</b>

06:36.330 --> 06:37.710
<b>And in exchange...</b>

06:37.710 --> 06:42.290
<b>I'll order my children to tackle the dungeon and ensure
significant progress is made towards conquering it.</b>

06:42.920 --> 06:46.880
<b>That includes exploring the still unknown floors and
laying the groundwork to defeat the Black Dragon.</b>

06:47.130 --> 06:49.380
<b>I'll get it all done for you.</b>

06:49.580 --> 06:52.040
<b>The "Machia". What do you say?</b>

06:52.170 --> 06:56.250
<b>I will not condone the malicious course
of action that you have taken.</b>

06:56.250 --> 06:59.170
<b>However, the fact remains
I am incapable of stopping you...</b>

06:59.920 --> 07:03.130
<b>So I will turn a blind eye and let you do as you please.</b>

07:04.460 --> 07:06.920
<b>I knew you were just as shrewd as me.</b>

07:11.750 --> 07:13.380
<b>Is it true, Ouranos?</b>

07:13.880 --> 07:17.460
<b>Have the rest of us all been charmed by Goddess Freya?</b>

07:17.750 --> 07:18.420
<b>Yes.</b>

07:19.000 --> 07:24.830
<b>If I make any moves against her, I have no doubt that
even you would turn around and blow the whistle on me.</b>

07:25.380 --> 07:28.580
<b>Oblivious servitude? That's hard to swallow.</b>

07:29.040 --> 07:32.040
<b>There is nothing for me to do but sit back and watch.</b>

07:32.330 --> 07:35.920
<b>And whether or not I will continue to do that forever...</b>

07:36.250 --> 07:38.170
<b>depends entirely on Bell Cranel.</b>

07:39.670 --> 07:41.210
<b>This is all my equipment.</b>

07:41.750 --> 07:45.130
<b>Except for... the knife I got from Goddess Hestia.</b>

07:49.790 --> 07:52.880
<b>Lady Freya has graced us with her presence. Come.</b>

07:55.500 --> 07:57.920
<b>Master... er, Mr. Hedin...</b>

07:57.920 --> 07:58.580
<b>What is it?</b>

07:58.750 --> 08:02.250
<b>Do you know if there's anyone around here named "Syr"?</b>

08:02.580 --> 08:06.750
<b>She's a human girl who works at
a tavern called the "Hostess of Fertility".</b>

08:07.130 --> 08:09.630
<b>There is no such girl among our ranks.</b>

08:12.580 --> 08:14.920
<b>Lady Freya. We have arrived.</b>

08:15.380 --> 08:16.380
<b>You may enter.</b>

08:20.670 --> 08:21.830
<b>Welcome, Bell.</b>

08:22.880 --> 08:27.580
<b>My apologies that I wasn't able
to make time for you right away.</b>

08:27.960 --> 08:30.630
<b>I've heard what happened.
Have you really lost all your memories of us?</b>

08:34.710 --> 08:37.000
<b>I guess you're not just joking around.</b>

08:37.250 --> 08:40.960
<b>Am I... Have I really been part
of the Freya Familia all along?</b>

08:40.960 --> 08:43.920
<b>Yes. I was taken with you at first sight.</b>

08:44.460 --> 08:46.880
<b>And you've been one of my children ever since we met.</b>

08:47.000 --> 08:49.170
<b>All right, then I want you to prove it to me.</b>

08:49.540 --> 08:52.920
<b>Please update my status! Right here and now!</b>

08:53.580 --> 08:56.750
<b>The only one who can update my status
is the patron God of my real Familia.</b>

08:57.420 --> 08:59.130
<b>Which means it should be impossible for Lady Freya to
do!</b>

09:01.500 --> 09:03.210
<b>Heith. Fetch the needle.</b>

09:11.080 --> 09:12.790
<b>Impossible. Is she serious?</b>

09:13.170 --> 09:15.420
<b>No, she can't be. It's just a bluff.</b>

09:16.540 --> 09:19.040
<b>Make sure you stay still like usual, okay?</b>

09:32.080 --> 09:32.830
<b>All done.</b>

09:35.080 --> 09:37.380
<b>It seems your vitality has gotten a large boost.</b>

09:37.540 --> 09:39.630
<b>Has Hedin been putting you through the wringer again?</b>

09:44.920 --> 09:46.580
<b>No... no way...</b>

09:48.330 --> 09:49.330
<b>That broke him.</b>

09:50.250 --> 09:51.830
<b>Status Snitch.</b>

09:52.710 --> 09:56.630
<b>A rare item that allows a different Familia
to update any given person's stats.</b>

09:56.960 --> 09:59.630
<b>I knew getting this from Rivira was a good idea.</b>

10:06.830 --> 10:08.290
<b>It's going to be okay, Bell.</b>

10:09.210 --> 10:12.920
<b>I understand this all might be difficult
for you to process right now.</b>

10:13.290 --> 10:15.040
<b>But please, don't let it ruin you.</b>

10:15.710 --> 10:18.170
<b>See? You're practically freezing.</b>

10:19.420 --> 10:24.960
<b>Even if solitude is the only thing that you can bear
right now, I refuse to leave you by yourself.</b>

10:28.080 --> 10:30.960
<b>Come, Bell. Tell me about yourself, would you?</b>

10:31.080 --> 10:31.670
<b>Huh?</b>

10:31.670 --> 10:37.080
<b>I want to hear more about him.
This other Bell who isn't part of my Familia.</b>

10:37.790 --> 10:40.420
<b>You can say whatever you want and I won't refute it.</b>

10:40.880 --> 10:44.960
<b>Because I care more about who you are now
and will be in the future.</b>

10:48.290 --> 10:52.250
<b>During the day, I want you to train
with the other children like usual.</b>

10:52.580 --> 10:54.580
<b>But once that's over, come here and we'll talk.</b>

10:55.210 --> 10:56.580
<b>Just the two of us.</b>

10:57.000 --> 10:58.380
<b>All right, I guess.</b>

10:58.670 --> 11:00.250
<b>Then I'll see you tomorrow night.</b>

11:02.500 --> 11:04.670
<b>Or would you prefer we just
hop in bed together right now?</b>

11:05.290 --> 11:06.630
<b>N-no, thank you!</b>

11:07.790 --> 11:08.630
<b>What a shame.</b>

11:09.290 --> 11:12.250
<b>You must be exhausted.
Go to your room and get some rest.</b>

11:12.580 --> 11:13.830
<b>R-right!</b>

11:17.830 --> 11:20.500
<b>Keep some guards posted on Bell without him noticing.</b>

11:21.000 --> 11:23.420
<b>And report all of his movements to me.</b>

11:23.710 --> 11:24.880
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

11:27.000 --> 11:27.750
<b>Bell...</b>

11:28.290 --> 11:30.920
<b>I'm going to have to hurt you over and over again.</b>

11:31.630 --> 11:35.500
<b>But for each of those wounds,
I'll embrace you and kiss them all better.</b>

11:35.670 --> 11:37.830
<b>I promise you that.</b>

11:38.460 --> 11:40.130
<b>So please forgive me.</b>

11:40.710 --> 11:44.130
<b>Because I've made up my mind to do whatever it takes.</b>

11:48.630 --> 11:51.040
<b>Why did I have to get saddled with training this chump?</b>

11:51.830 --> 11:53.960
<b>Quit spacing out and move your ass!</b>

11:53.960 --> 11:55.040
<b>Okay, Mr. Van!</b>

11:55.250 --> 11:57.790
<b>A curse? Who gives a shit.</b>

11:57.790 --> 12:01.210
<b>If you ask me, you're nothing but
a damn rookie with a big head!</b>

12:01.210 --> 12:03.250
<b>You better not expect me to go easy on you!</b>

12:03.830 --> 12:06.210
<b>Is this really what I should be doing right now?</b>

12:06.710 --> 12:09.500
<b>It feels like I have more important things
to consider and work on...</b>

12:09.710 --> 12:12.210
<b>Oh, come on! Don't give me those dead rabbit eyes!</b>

12:12.210 --> 12:13.460
<b>S-sorry, sir!</b>

12:15.460 --> 12:17.170
<b>I guess I better explain to you.</b>

12:17.830 --> 12:22.670
<b>All members of the Freya Familia gather in this field
for a battle to the death, regardless of their level.</b>

12:23.040 --> 12:25.380
<b>From sunup to sundown. Every day!</b>

12:25.380 --> 12:26.630
<b>Huh? We fight each oth-</b>

12:29.580 --> 12:31.420
<b>B-but what's the sign to start?!</b>

12:35.040 --> 12:36.460
<b>There is none!</b>

12:36.460 --> 12:40.330
<b>The battle begins immediately after
everyone has gathered outside!</b>

12:51.920 --> 12:54.670
<b>Holy crap. This really IS a battle to the death!</b>

12:54.830 --> 12:56.880
<b>They don't call it the Fólkvangr for nothing!</b>

13:02.420 --> 13:03.880
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

13:30.540 --> 13:32.630
<b>D-dammit!</b>

13:33.210 --> 13:35.290
<b>It took multiple magic blasts to finally bring them down.</b>

13:36.000 --> 13:38.210
<b>But now I'm too tired to keep fighting...</b>

13:39.000 --> 13:40.210
<b>Excellent work.</b>

13:42.960 --> 13:45.170
<b>He can carry his own weight at the very least.</b>

13:45.790 --> 13:46.580
<b>Nevertheless...</b>

13:47.000 --> 13:48.670
<b>we seek power of an even greater degree</b>

13:49.000 --> 13:51.330
<b>so that we may appease our Goddess.</b>

13:52.790 --> 13:54.460
<b>Time is limited.</b>

13:54.830 --> 13:58.170
<b>The current version of you will die
and be reborn in the fires of battle.</b>

13:58.580 --> 14:00.880
<b>Your true christening begins now.</b>

14:07.420 --> 14:09.330
<b>Cranel, Cranel...</b>

14:11.210 --> 14:12.000
<b>Huh?</b>

14:12.750 --> 14:16.330
<b>Mister Cranel's documentation is gone.
Did someone take it out?</b>

14:18.750 --> 14:20.750
<b>I can't figure out why this is bothering me so much.</b>

14:22.000 --> 14:23.880
<b>I mean, I don't even know the guy.</b>

14:24.670 --> 14:28.000
<b>But there was definitely something strange
going on when I saw him that one time...</b>

14:32.750 --> 14:36.420
<b>Aw jeez! Why do I never clean up after myself?!</b>

14:41.750 --> 14:44.170
<b>Bell Cranel Logbook...?</b>

14:49.630 --> 14:52.750
<b>"I was forced into becoming
an advisor for Mr. Bell Cranel."</b>

14:53.250 --> 14:58.290
<b>"He might have zero aptitude for becoming an
adventurer, but I refuse to let him die out there."</b>

14:59.170 --> 15:02.420
<b>"I can't believe he broke our promise and
went all the way down to the 5th floor!"</b>

15:02.790 --> 15:06.920
<b>"Not only was he on the verge of dying,
but he ran through town covered in blood."</b>

15:08.290 --> 15:10.920
<b>"He reached level 2 after soloing a Minotaur."</b>

15:11.580 --> 15:14.960
<b>"You know, this kid might actually turn out
to be an incredible adventurer."</b>

15:16.080 --> 15:18.040
<b>"I got violent with him for the first time."</b>

15:18.750 --> 15:20.540
<b>"He refuses to tell me the truth."</b>

15:21.330 --> 15:25.920
<b>"Word is that he attacked other adventurers and
now everybody hates him. But why would he?"</b>

15:26.830 --> 15:33.750
<b>"I'm in big trouble! I know I shouldn't have these kind of
feelings... especially not for an adventurer who I advise!"</b>

15:34.040 --> 15:35.380
<b>"It's so shameless!"</b>

15:36.880 --> 15:39.080
<b>"But I don't want to pretend they don't exist."</b>

15:39.540 --> 15:44.000
<b>"No matter what happens from here on out,
I always want to keep these feeling in my heart."</b>

15:44.540 --> 15:47.540
<b>It's incredible you'd still yearn for him,
even when you're not cognizant of what happened.</b>

15:48.750 --> 15:50.960
<b>A fascinating case. But problematic.</b>

15:51.290 --> 15:52.920
<b>G-Goddess Freya?!</b>

15:53.420 --> 15:57.790
<b>You have no real power to speak of
and yet you're resisting the will of a God.</b>

15:58.210 --> 15:59.500
<b>I'm honestly jealous.</b>

15:59.960 --> 16:02.830
<b>It's like you and Bell are tied
together by some special bond.</b>

16:06.000 --> 16:10.750
<b>This will be coming with me.
Don't worry, I won't throw it away.</b>

16:10.920 --> 16:11.580
<b>But...!</b>

16:14.710 --> 16:20.000
<b>I'll send someone to fetch the rest of your documents
later. You just go on and forget about everything.</b>

16:21.580 --> 16:22.130
<b>Okay.</b>

16:27.250 --> 16:29.630
<b>Huh? What am I crying for...?</b>

16:38.380 --> 16:39.670
<b>Zeo Gullveig.</b>

16:46.540 --> 16:48.420
<b>That was a close call.</b>

16:48.420 --> 16:51.170
<b>You were seriously on the verge of going to the grave.</b>

16:51.540 --> 16:54.670
<b>Okay, everyone! You'll have to call it quits for today!</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:56.210
<b>The sun is just about to go down, anyways.</b>

16:56.210 --> 16:57.630
<b>Hmph. If you insist.</b>

16:57.630 --> 17:02.790
<b>Today tis the day the amnesiac
is born anew. Well fought.</b>

17:03.000 --> 17:06.250
<b>You will fight with us again tomorrow. Come prepared.</b>

17:07.130 --> 17:09.250
<b>I have to go through this hell again tomorrow...?</b>

17:10.210 --> 17:13.080
<b>Plus the day after that and the next, I'm sure.</b>

17:13.080 --> 17:15.710
<b>Well, I'll make sure you don't have to worry about dying.</b>

17:16.040 --> 17:17.330
<b>Come on. Let's go.</b>

17:24.170 --> 17:24.920
<b>I need booze!</b>

17:24.920 --> 17:25.790
<b>Gimme meat!</b>

17:27.040 --> 17:31.710
<b>All right, here! We're short-staffed right now,
so I've brought everything straight to you!</b>

17:32.630 --> 17:33.250
<b>Meat!</b>

17:33.250 --> 17:34.920
<b>Fork it over! It's mine!</b>

17:40.790 --> 17:42.710
<b>What's wrong, Mr. Van?</b>

17:43.170 --> 17:46.750
<b>I can deal with pretending that little punk is our comrade.</b>

17:46.960 --> 17:49.460
<b>As much as I hate to admit it, he's strong.</b>

17:49.710 --> 17:55.960
<b>But dammit, why does he get to have a total monopoly
on her love?! We all want attention from our Goddess!</b>

17:56.290 --> 17:58.170
<b>Oh, that's an easy one.</b>

18:00.380 --> 18:01.830
<b>It's because he's special.</b>

18:02.290 --> 18:05.380
<b>She's drawn to him in a way that she can't help.</b>

18:11.710 --> 18:14.420
<b>Lady Freya. Bell has arrived.</b>

18:17.380 --> 18:18.630
<b>Let him through.</b>

18:23.080 --> 18:24.290
<b>Excuse me.</b>

18:24.540 --> 18:26.750
<b>Bell! Thank you for coming.</b>

18:27.290 --> 18:30.920
<b>The promised time has come. Let me hear all about you.</b>

18:33.880 --> 18:36.170
<b>I first came to Orario all by myself.</b>

18:36.170 --> 18:39.460
<b>But not a single Familia was willing to let me join them.</b>

18:40.170 --> 18:44.960
<b>After wandering on the streets,
it was Goddess Hestia who found me and took me in...</b>

18:45.670 --> 18:48.380
<b>Oh? That sounds like a real struggle.</b>

18:49.040 --> 18:50.380
<b>What happened after that?</b>

18:51.040 --> 18:57.960
<b>Um, well... back then, Goddess Hestia's home was
inside of a run-down and abandoned church.</b>

19:04.630 --> 19:09.460
<b>How interesting. It seems this version
of you is also remarkably brave.</b>

19:09.790 --> 19:11.210
<b>No, not really.</b>

19:11.960 --> 19:15.920
<b>So... where did you and I first meet, Lady Freya?</b>

19:16.960 --> 19:18.460
<b>The Adventurer's Graveyard.</b>

19:19.330 --> 19:24.960
<b>I went there one day to lay some flowers, and
found you looking at a monument dedicated to heroes.</b>

19:27.920 --> 19:30.000
<b>And that's where I fell in love.</b>

19:30.000 --> 19:31.500
<b>F-fell in love?!</b>

19:31.500 --> 19:36.920
<b>When I called out to ask, "Will you join my Familia?",
you nearly tumbled over backwards.</b>

19:37.500 --> 19:41.040
<b>And when I brought you back home with me,
you almost fainted at the sight of Ottarl.</b>

19:44.210 --> 19:46.750
<b>Which reminds me, your first time in the dungeon,</b>

19:46.750 --> 19:50.960
<b>you only defeated a single goblin,
but you came back in such high spirits.</b>

19:51.670 --> 19:53.210
<b>It was adorable.</b>

19:54.460 --> 19:56.040
<b>That really did happen...</b>

19:56.250 --> 19:59.460
<b>But the only people who I told about it
are Goddess Hestia and Ms. Eina.</b>

19:59.670 --> 20:00.630
<b>How'd she know?</b>

20:00.920 --> 20:04.040
<b>O-okay, what about the time that I ranked up to level 2?</b>

20:04.460 --> 20:06.040
<b>You were down on the 5th floor.</b>

20:06.040 --> 20:10.130
<b>And you defeated a minotaur that
the Loki children failed to take care of.</b>

20:10.920 --> 20:12.210
<b>What about level 3?!</b>

20:12.670 --> 20:15.080
<b>I had you defeat the children of the Apollon Familia.</b>

20:15.380 --> 20:17.250
<b>But it wasn't in a War Game.</b>

20:17.580 --> 20:22.080
<b>I simply crushed Apollon at the same time as Ishtar
after she schemed to steal you away from me.</b>

20:23.750 --> 20:26.000
<b>Whenever people are faced with an impossible reality,</b>

20:26.540 --> 20:29.080
<b>their first instinct is to cling to their personal beliefs.</b>

20:29.080 --> 20:31.750
<b>But given enough time they even begin to doubt
those...</b>

20:32.830 --> 20:37.380
<b>I'll become the only person who can show you
compassion, and make you dependent upon it.</b>

20:37.790 --> 20:40.170
<b>But that's enough for today...</b>

20:41.040 --> 20:42.040
<b>Say, Bell.</b>

20:42.630 --> 20:45.330
<b>You haven't paid any attention
to this dress of mine, have you?</b>

20:45.670 --> 20:46.250
<b>Huh?</b>

20:46.880 --> 20:48.790
<b>I'm going to get changed. Help me out.</b>

20:49.040 --> 20:49.830
<b>Say what?</b>

20:49.830 --> 20:53.960
<b>I can't get out of it on my own. My hands can't reach
the buttons in back.</b>

20:54.580 --> 20:55.250
<b>Bwa?!</b>

20:55.880 --> 21:00.540
<b>Will you start it for me?
Then I'll do the rest myself. Please?</b>

21:02.710 --> 21:06.210
<b>Do you think this dress was too provocative for your
liking?</b>

21:06.630 --> 21:08.670
<b>Or maybe it just doesn't look good on me?</b>

21:09.080 --> 21:12.710
<b>No, that's not true. You look great. Fantastic.</b>

21:18.500 --> 21:21.790
<b>S-s-s-s-s-s-sorry!</b>

21:29.790 --> 21:32.670
<b>Look at him fleeing from my room
in the middle of the night!</b>

21:32.670 --> 21:35.540
<b>No man has ever! Not even among the Gods!</b>

21:43.540 --> 21:46.830
<b>Lady Freya? I've prepared a change of clothes for you.</b>

21:46.960 --> 21:48.040
<b>I don't need them.</b>

21:48.960 --> 21:51.710
<b>After all, he said this looks fantastic on me!</b>

21:53.040 --> 21:54.420
<b>So I'll wear it to sleep tonight.</b>

21:59.920 --> 22:05.130
<b>Goddess Hestia, is this really... who I am?</b>

22:19.080 --> 22:21.710
<b>Kono himitsu shizume</b>

22:21.710 --> 22:24.170
<b>Yuredasu suimen ni</b>

22:24.580 --> 22:28.750
<b>Kizuku yochi ga atta mitai</b>

22:29.540 --> 22:36.250
<b>Umaku arawasenai sore de ite masshiro na omoi</b>

22:36.250 --> 22:39.420
<b>Yobeba mata hoshiku naru</b>

22:39.420 --> 22:44.420
<b>Hayaru kanjou sore wa uneru nami no you</b>

22:44.790 --> 22:50.000
<b>Chikutto sotto shirazu ni hareteku</b>

22:51.080 --> 22:57.630
<b>Soshite hedateta kabe kuzurete rikai shita kotoba wa</b>

22:57.750 --> 23:02.080
<b>Tada yuratto sora ni ukanderu</b>

23:02.580 --> 23:08.130
<b>Tatoe kara demo koeteku ai hoshii</b>

23:08.380 --> 23:13.710
<b>Douse yume nara uso mo tsuredashite</b>

23:13.710 --> 23:17.380
<b>Tatoe ubaenai sei demo</b>

23:17.500 --> 23:22.960
<b>Kokoro o sukoshi mitashite kawaru</b>

23:23.250 --> 23:28.920
<b>Memai no you na muku na kasumi</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Loneliness</b>

23:36.090 --> 23:41.040
<b>Separated</b>

23:36.790 --> 23:39.080
<b>Next time: "Loneliness".</b>
